383
00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.560
Aha moment.

384
00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:23.720
A moment of sudden realization, inspiration, insight, recognition, or comprehension.

385
00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:28.680
I always love those moments when I sit down to talk to somebody and they say something

386
00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:34.240
that makes me look at life or a situation in a completely different way.

387
00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:38.440
And I say, aha, I get it.

388
00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:41.560
Light bulb, bing, bing, bing, bing moment.

389
00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:44.780
And the little hairs on your arms stand up.

390
00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.100
That is an aha moment.

391
00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:53.780
I mean, that is so perfectly described.

392
00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:54.440
I know.

393
00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:55.500
Thank you, Oprah.

394
00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.140
I know.

395
00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:58.960
And then, okay, here's what the article said.

396
00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:02.720
But I also like, I think it's the fanciest way I've ever heard a word described.

397
00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:03.360
Aha.

398
00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:04.980
I love it.

