405
00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:36.620
Oh, my gosh.

406
00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:43.760
Could you imagine coining a phrase that then became recognized by the dictionary?

407
00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:44.840
I know.

408
00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.680
That's like Oprah did that.

409
00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.820
Oprah really made it popular.

410
00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:53.160
She went on in an interview in 2017 on the Harry Connick Jr.

411
00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.560
