Come on.

1295
00:57:42.380 --> 00:57:43.340
Come on.

1296
00:57:44.580 --> 00:57:45.060
Schlamydia.

1297
00:57:47.540 --> 00:57:48.320
Oh, man.

1298
00:57:48.620 --> 00:57:52.620
