1343
01:00:03.320 --> 01:00:04.200
Uncrumpling it.

1344
01:00:04.380 --> 01:00:06.640
Uncrumpling it and saying, it was the original.

1345
01:00:06.920 --> 01:00:07.780
That is great.

1346
01:00:07.980 --> 01:00:09.220
I love that.

1347
01:00:09.440 --> 01:00:10.540
So fun.

