1563
01:09:37.620 --> 01:09:38.500
It's so fun.

1564
01:09:38.640 --> 01:09:39.400
It's so fun.

1565
01:09:39.500 --> 01:09:41.420
And he's so smart and interesting.

1566
01:09:41.820 --> 01:09:43.540
We really hung on his every word.

1567
01:09:43.660 --> 01:09:44.080
We pretty much did.

1568
01:09:44.080 --> 01:09:44.900
It's such a great interview.

1569
01:09:45.620 --> 01:09:48.860
Well, this episode is going to end with something we've never seen before.

